{title: Baarish Lete Aana}
{artist: Darshan Raval}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] Aati ho toh baarish lete [Bm] aana,        Jee [G] bhar ke rone ka dil karta [A] hai
[D] Rehti hai ye khwahish hontho [Bm] par hi,        Jab [G] bhi yeh dil mera jo bharta [A] hai
Kuch [D] khwaab likhe hai khaton mein,        [Bm] Tumko sonp doon
Iss [G] dard ki zameen pe main,        [D] Khudko ronp doon
[D] Waqt ki thi humse [F#m] kuch naraazgi,        [Bm] Keh na sake hum wo [F#m] baate aaj bhi
[G] Jinko liye hum tum [D] ho gaye judaa,        [D] Phir bhi woh lamhein tum lete [Bm] aana
[G] Aadhe adhure se jo [A] choote the,        [D] Taare bhi woh saare lete [Bm] aana
Jo [G] humne dekha tha ki toote [A] the,        Kuch [D] chal raha hai saath saath
[Bm] Aur hai kuch thama,        Gham [G] beh raha hai aas paas
[D] Aur hai kuch jama,        [D] Aati ho toh baarish lete [Bm] aana
Jee [G] bhar ke rone ka dil karta [A] hai,        [D] Rehti hai ye khwahish hontho [Bm] par hi
Jab [G] bhi yeh dil mera jo bharta [A] hai [D]
